# Architecture

This folder contains the **data architecture diagram** for the project, created with [Draw.io](https://app.diagrams.net/).

## Files

| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `sql-data-warehouse-project-1-data-architecture.drawio` | Full end-to-end data architecture diagram |

## How to Open

1. Go to [draw.io](https://app.diagrams.net/)
2. Download the `.drawio` file
3. Click **File → Open from → Device**
4. Select the `.drawio` file from this folder

Alternatively, if using VS Code, install the **Draw.io Integration** extension to open `.drawio` files directly in the editor.

## Architecture Overview

The diagram covers:
- **Data Sources** — origin systems and ingestion points
- **Staging Layer** — raw landing zone for data
- **Core / DWH Layer** — cleaned and integrated data
- **Reporting Layer** — aggregated and presentation-ready data
- **Consumers** — BI tools, dashboards, and end users
